      "description": "ETIPI's Data Center is one of Brazil’s most modern, state-run digital hubs, serving as the primary hosting environment for the Government of Piauí. Housed within a certified ABNT NBR 15.247 “sala-cofre” and secure colocation hall, it concentrates over 800 virtual machines running critical applications for multiple state agencies. Its infrastructure delivers permanent power (on-site generators and UPS), dual-link internet redundancy, advanced fire detection/suppression and multilayered physical security to guarantee continuous operation.\n\nThanks to recent investments exceeding R$ 3 million, the center’s storage and backup capacity has grown sixfold—now offering 480 TB of primary disk space, 100 high-capacity backup tapes and dedicated support servers. Classified as a Tier III facility, it meets stringent requirements for concurrent maintainability, fault tolerance and high availability, ensuring uninterrupted delivery of essential public-sector services.",
